# Copy to tests/aci-simulator/.env (gitignored) and chmod 600 it, to give the
# tests a Cisco ACI fabric to run against: an APIC, such as DevNet's
# always-on ACI simulator sandbox or a reserved one.
#
# Nothing reads these yet: The Pleiades has no ACI device type, method or
# test today. This file names the settings ACI work will read, so the
# sandbox can be set up before it lands. Until then filling it in runs
# nothing.
#
# The DevNet sandbox's page lists the APIC's address and its login; it is
# shared with every other visitor, so anything run against it should only
# read, or create and remove its own objects in the same run.
#
# The APIC's base URL (https and the host, no path).
PLEIADES_E2E_APIC_URL=https://sandboxapicdc.cisco.com
# Its login.
PLEIADES_E2E_APIC_USER=admin
PLEIADES_E2E_APIC_PASS=
